<title>USA: Milton Federal to buy back 5 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Milton Federal to buy back 5 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MILTON, Ohio 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milton Federal Financial Corp said Tuesday it plans to buy back up to five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The number of shares purchased and the price to be paid will depend up on availablity and market prices, it said.</p>
<p>The shares may be purchased in the over-the-counter market for the next six months, the company said.</p>
<p>The purchase program will be funded by the sale of securities from Milton Federal's investment portfolio, the company said.</p>
</text>
